" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_BardSonFunds</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_BardSonFunds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_OskarsBeloved_BardSonFunds\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5ba27a15-2f96-4a85-8dd5-6d10447263fe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5ba27a15-2f96-4a85-8dd5-6d10447263fe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5ba27a15-2f96-4a85-8dd5-6d10447263fe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a>, if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/38px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/50px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oskar Fevras\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png/25px-Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Portrait_Oskar_Fevras.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oskar_Fevras\" title=\"Oskar Fevras\">Oskar Fevras</a> isn't rescued in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, there are 2 nobles on the first floor, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gorran_Penghyst\" title=\"Gorran Penghyst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png/25px-Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png/38px-Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png/50px-Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gorran Penghyst\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png/25px-Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Portrait_Gorran_Penghyst.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gorran_Penghyst\" title=\"Gorran Penghyst\">Gorran Penghyst</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Delwaer_Jeth\" title=\"Delwaer Jeth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png/25px-Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png/38px-Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png/50px-Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Delwaer Jeth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png/25px-Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Portrait_Delwaer_Jeth.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Delwaer_Jeth\" title=\"Delwaer Jeth\">Delwaer Jeth</a>, at each other's throat. They will will move to the outside on the balcony to duel. Gorran Penghyst carries this letter.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dear Daddy,\n</p><p><br>\nHow fare everything back home? I hope elegantly and without truculence.\n</p><p><br>\nLook, Daddykins, I amn't going to bugger around the bush here. I need coin. Cash. Moneys. Squids as they say down at the docks.\n</p><p><br>\nI have eight potential patrons for my music chomping at the bit. Another month and they'll be growling and biting, and that is when I'll swear fealty and make my fortune! Meantime: squids please! Your darling boy must eat!\n</p><p><br>\nWith Love,\n</p><p><br>\nYour Aspiring Bard, and Actual Son\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205816\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31960/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9054/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935654/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time